        "id": 1499410
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T18:51:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the patch stays, would you mind moving this branch into `include/linux/p3s/futex.h`, in place of `p3s_futex_page_offset()`? After this patch nothing includes that header, here or at the top of the chain.\n\nA helper that calls `get_user_pages_fast()` for other mms, and `get_user_pages_range()` plus the key offset for 4KB mms, would leave `get_futex_key()` with upstream\u0027s single GUP block, including the read-only comment (which this patch drops) and the error handling, and change only the two calls, e.g. to `p3s_futex_get_page(mm, uaddr, size, FOLL_WRITE, \u0026page, key)`.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "61d0ca67dfe5f1d9bf8d267fd5bc72d83603cc97",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f406f580_b211d376",
        "filename": "kernel/futex/core.c",
        "patchSetId": 13
      },
      "lineNbr": 646,
      "author": {
        "id": 1499410
